    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300100303/3001003030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 3001003030140,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "そうだね、お弁当を食べよう",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300100303/3001003030140"
  },
  {
    "id": 3001003030150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でも、鳩がこんなにいるところでお弁当広げたら、\r\nいっぱい寄ってきて大変なことになるんじゃない？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300100303/3001003030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 3001003030160,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "鳩さんなら寄ってきても大丈夫だよ\r\nみんないい子さんばかりだから",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300100303/3001003030160"
  },
  {
    "id": 3001003030170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうなの？\r\nわかった、ここでお昼にしよう",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300100303/3001003030170"
  },
  {
    "id": 3001003030180,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "今日は張り切ってお弁当作ったの\r\n……灯織ちゃんもよかったらどうぞっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300100303/3001003030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 3001003030190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "美味しそうだね\r\n……これが私の",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300100303/3001003030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 3001003030200,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわっ、すごいっ\r\nおかずがたくさん入ってて美味しそう",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300100303/3001003030200"
  },
  {
    "id": 3001003030210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "普通のお弁当じゃない？\r\n特別なものは別に入れてないけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300100303/3001003030210"
  },
  {
    "id": 3001003030220,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ～！　でも、どれも手が込んでいるようにみえるよっ\r\n灯織ちゃん、お料理上手なんだね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300100303/3001003030220"
  },
  {
    "id": 3001003030230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "普通だよ、普通\r\n……これくらい、普段から家事してたら作れるよ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300100303/3001003030230"
  },
  {
    "id": 3001003030240,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……！　いつも家事をしているの……！！\r\n灯織ちゃんすごいなぁ～",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300100303/3001003030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 3001003030250,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "だからこんなに美味しそうなお弁当が作れるんだね",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300100303/3001003030250"
  },
  {
    "id": 3001003030260,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そ……そんないいものじゃないってば\r\nほら、人のを見てばかりいないで、自分のを食べなよ",
    "charAnim1": "shy3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300100303/3001003030260"
  },
  {
    "id": 3001003030270,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわっ、そうだね……ごめんなさい灯織ちゃん\r\n一緒にピクニックに来れたことが嬉しくって",
